# Visual regression (scripts/tv-shots.mjs). The BASELINE and the recorded fixtures are the
# reference and are committed deliberately — a baseline that lives only on one machine
# cannot fail anyone else's build, which is the entire point of having one. Per-run output
# is not: `current/` is regenerated every check and `diff/` is a debugging artefact.
screenshots/current/
screenshots/diff/
screenshots/record/
*.local

# vite-plugin-pwa emits this the moment devOptions.enabled is turned on
dev-dist

